    question: 'What\'s the difference between a business VPN and a consumer VPN?',
    answer: '<p>Consumer VPNs (like NordVPN or ExpressVPN) protect individual users by encrypting their traffic and hiding their IP address. Business VPNs add features specifically for organizations:</p><ul><li><strong>Centralized management:</strong> Admin dashboards to manage all users</li><li><strong>Team permissions:</strong> Control who accesses which resources</li><li><strong>Audit logging:</strong> Track access for compliance</li><li><strong>SSO integration:</strong> Connect to your existing identity provider</li><li><strong>Dedicated infrastructure:</strong> Private servers for your organization only</li><li><strong>Compliance certifications:</strong> SOC 2, GDPR, HIPAA support</li></ul>'
